  "details": "Getting looping/stuttering of QM sounds after interacting with Udon behaviours that play audio on Desktop (VR is not affected). Additionally, the audio clip fails to play unless 'Bypass Effects' is checked despite there being no audio filter components.\nPinned it down to it only happening with audio sources that are on the same game object as the Udon Behaviour that plays it. Moving the audio source to a child object resolves it w/ no changes to the behavior besides changing the public variable for the audio source.\nExample: https://streamable.com/vkkha7\nRepro world: wrld_2591b39a-f8bc-49e1-9f5e-b9577c9775e5\nThis seems to happen with or without spatial audio source, across multiple PCs (to account for possible audio driver weirdness), and with different audio clips.\nHesitant to call this an open beta bug because I hear some static + can trigger a stutter occasionally on live too - but definitely way more noticeable here.\nUnsure, but possibly related to: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-switching-avatars-quickly-freezes-all-audio-then-freezes-game (?)",
